      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Section 92 of the General Municipal Law permits the Mayor of the City of New York to provide for lump sum payment of the monetary value of accumulated and unused vacation time or compensatory time allowances standing to the credit of its officers and employees at time of their separation from the service;",
