        120,
        1958,
        1820,
        2227
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "2. The Director of the Budget of the City of New York is hereby designated and empowered to transfer such necessary funds that may be required in accordance with Section 124a and/or b of the City Charter for the payment to such terminated employees of the monetary value of accumulated and unused vacation time or compensatory time allowed standing to the credit of such employees.",
